      "decision": "source_only",
      "finding": "Anonymous four-model design tournaments produce five pairwise votes and Bradley-Terry preference ratings. Overall Frontend, Website, Web Apps, Fullstack and Image to HTML are separate categories. The dynamic model page changed during review, and its all-category tournament count is not a category sample size; no synchronized category score imported."
    },
