      "decision": "retain_existing_scores",
      "finding": "August 6 v0.0.4 release has 1,100 uniform training routes and a separate 220-route validation benchmark. Existing plotted v0.0.4 rows already include LEAD Driving Score 95.59 / Success Rate 87.28 and Simlingo 86.55 / 70.45. System run dates remain unavailable."
    },
